# 统一换行与二进制识别
# 仓库内与工作区都用 LF，避免 Windows 上 core.autocrlf 反复改写、反复告警；
# 批处理和 PowerShell 脚本单独覆盖成 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.py   text
*.md   text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.txt  text
*.json text
*.toml text
*.cfg  text
*.ini  text

# Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 可能解析异常
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.zip binary
